le': 'SIDUS SPACE AND L3HARRIS TEAM FOR THE DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE MENTOR-PROTÉGÉ PROGRAM', 'text': 'CAPE CANAVERAL, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SIDUS SPACE, INC. (NASDAQ:SIDU), A SPACE-AS-A-SERVICE COMPANY FOCUSED ON COMMERCIAL SATELLITE DESIGN, MANUFACTURE, LAUNCH, AND DATA COLLECTION, IS TEAMING WITH L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE:LHX) FOR THE DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE MENTOR-PROTÉGÉ PROGRAM (MPP). THE DOD PROGRAM HELPS BUSINESSES EXPAND THEIR FOOTPRINT IN THE DEFENSE INDUSTRIAL BASE BY SUPPORTING THEIR PARTNERING EFFORTS WITH LARGER COMPANIES, SUCH AS L3HARRIS.'}{'symbol': 'LVS', 'date': '2023-04-11 13:00:00', 'title': 'LAS VEGAS SANDS WELCOMES THE LGBTQ CENTER OF SOUTHERN NEVADA INTO THE SANDS CARES ACCELERATOR', 'text': "SANDS' 2023 PARTNERSHIP WITH THE CENTER INCLUDES ENTRY INTO THE THREE-YEAR PROGRAM, ALONG WITH CAPACITY-BUILDING SUPPORT TO HELP THE NONPROFIT ADVANCE ITS SERVICE TO THE LGBTQ+ COMMUNITY."}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-04-11 05:45:00', 'title': 'MTCH ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MAY 5, 2023 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF MATCH GROUP, INC. SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , APRIL 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF MATCH GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ: MTCH) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS.'}{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2023-04-11 07:00:00', 'title': 'MODERNA ANNOUNCES CLINICAL AND PROGRAM UPDATES AT 4TH VACCINES DAY', 'text': "NEXT-GENERATION, REFRIGERATOR-STABLE COVID-19 VACCINE CANDIDATE, MRNA-1283, HAS DOSED FIRST PARTICIPANT IN ITS PHASE 3 TRIAL COMPANY EXPECTS TO FILE FOR APPROVAL OF ITS INVESTIGATIONAL RSV VACCINE CANDIDATE, MRNA-1345, THIS QUARTER COMPANY'S FIRST INFLUENZA CANDIDATE, MRNA-1010, DID NOT ACCRUE SUFFICIENT CASES AT THE INTERIM EFFICACY ANALYSIS TO DECLARE EARLY SUCCESS IN THE PHASE 3 NORTHERN HEMISPHERE EFFICACY TRIAL AND THE INDEPENDENT DSMB RECOMMENDED CONTINUATION OF EFFICACY FOLLO